    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Emergent Convergence in Multi-Agent LLM Annotation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Parfenova%2C+A">Angelina Parfenova</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Denzler%2C+A">Alexander Denzler</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Pfeffer%2C+J">Juergen Pfeffer</a>
      
